{"step_index":507,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:49:51Z","input_tokens":3337,"cache_read_tokens":229587,"output_tokens":1153,"thinking":"The `snapshots` data structure contains `records`. Within `security_service` records that include `audit_record_*`, the goal is to extract the `resource_id` and the `subject_reference` or `user_id`, confirming the `State` is 'PRESENT'.\n\nNext, the focus shifts to text handover logs, specifically those matching the pattern `customer_account_handover_*.txt` or `evidence_03`. The objective is to parse lines using a regular expression to extract key information including timestamp, service, resource ID, user profile details and email.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python -c \\\"\\nimport sqlite3, csv, re\\nfrom datetime import datetime\\n\\nconn = sqlite3.connect(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\Pavan\\\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\\\cache\\\\northstar.db')\\nwith open(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\Pavan\\\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\\\dataset\\\\sample_output.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\\n    expected = {r['case_id']: r for r in csv.DictReader(f)}\\n\\nwith open(r'C:\\\\Users\\\\Pavan\\\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\\\dataset\\\\sample_deletion_requests.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\\n    cases = list(csv.DictReader(f))\\n\\n# Load all primary account submissions\\nsubmissions = []\\nfor t, det in conn.execute('''\\n    SELECT event_time, details FROM system_activity \\n    WHERE details LIKE 'Deletion worker submitted primary profile account_% to account_service.'\\n'''):\\n    m = re.search(r'account_\\\\d+', det)\\n    if m:\\n        t_dt = datetime.fromisoformat(t.replace('Z', '+00:00'))\\n        submissions.append((t_dt, m.group(0), det))\\n\\nfor c in cases[:10]:\\n    cid = c['case_id']\\n    req_at = datetime.fromisoformat(c['requested_at'].replace('Z', '+00:00'))\\n    rep_at = datetime.fromisoformat(c['reported_at'].replace('Z', '+00:00'))\\n    \\n    # Check expected account_XXXX in sample_output\\n    exp_acc = re.findall(r'account_\\\\d+', expected[cid]['steps_json'])\\n    \\n    # Candidates where event_time is between requested_at and reported_at (or within 10 min prior to reported_at)\\n    # pick one closest to reported_at\\n    candidates = []\\n    for t_dt, acc_id, det in submissions:\\n        if (req_at <= t_dt <= rep_at) or (0 <= (rep_at - t_dt).total_seconds() <= 600):\\n            candidates.append((abs((rep_at - t_dt).total_seconds()), acc_id, t_dt))\\n    \\n    candidates.sort()\\n    chosen = candidates[0] if candidates else None\\n    print(f'{cid} exp={exp_acc}: chosen={chosen}')\\n\\\"\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolSummary":"\"Check primary account matching on sample cases\""}}]}
{"step_index":508,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:50:03Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-25T01:20:03+05:30\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 51374649-1a7b-432a-985e-98e8fd1f22c3/task-508\nTask Description: python -c \"\nimport sqlite3, csv, re\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nconn = sqlite3.connect(r'C:\\Users\\Pavan\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\cache\\northstar.db')\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\Pavan\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\dataset\\sample_output.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\n    expected = {r['case_id']: r for r in csv.DictReader(f)}\n\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\Pavan\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26\\dataset\\sample_deletion_requests.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\n    cases = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n\n# Load all primary account submissions\nsubmissions = []\nfor t, det in conn.execute('''\n    SELECT event_time, details FROM system_activity \n    WHERE details LIKE 'Deletion worker submitted primary profile account_% to account_service.'\n'''):\n    m = re.search(r'account_\\d+', det)\n    if m:\n        t_dt = datetime.fromisoformat(t.replace('Z', '+00:00'))\n        submissions.append((t_dt, m.group(0), det))\n\nfor c in cases[:10]:\n    cid = c['case_id']\n    req_at = datetime.fromisoformat(c['requested_at'].replace('Z', '+00:00'))\n    rep_at = datetime.fromisoformat(c['reported_at'].replace('Z', '+00:00'))\n    \n    # Check expected account_XXXX in sample_output\n    exp_acc = re.findall(r'account_\\d+', expected[cid]['steps_json'])\n    \n    # Candidates where event_time is between requested_at and reported_at (or within 10 min prior to reported_at)\n    # pick one closest to reported_at\n    candidates = []\n    for t_dt, acc_id, det in submissions:\n        if (req_at <= t_dt <= rep_at) or (0 <= (rep_at - t_dt).total_seconds() <= 600):\n            candidates.append((abs((rep_at - t_dt).total_seconds()), acc_id, t_dt))\n    \n    candidates.sort()\n    chosen = candidates[0] if candidates else None\n    print(f'{cid} exp={exp_acc}: chosen={chosen}')\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/Pavan/.gemini/antigravity/brain/51374649-1a7b-432a-985e-98e8fd1f22c3/.system_generated/tasks/task-508.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
